---
// cspell:ignore nums
import { Gauge, Download } from "lucide-astro";
import evidence from "../content/evidence/local-capacity-2026-09-18.json";
import previous from "../content/evidence/local-overload-2026-09-03.json";
import PublicLayout from "../layouts/PublicLayout.astro";
const { lang = "en" } = Astro.props;
const zh = lang === "zh";
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => (zh ? cn : en);
const number = (value: number) => value.toLocaleString(zh ? "zh-CN" : "en-US");
const results = [
  [t("接收延迟 P95", "Ingest P95"), evidence.ingestP95Milliseconds + " ms", "< 250 ms"],
  [
    t("查询延迟 P95 / P99", "Query P95 / P99"),
    evidence.queryP95Milliseconds + " / " + evidence.queryP99Milliseconds + " ms",
    "< 2,000 / 5,000 ms",
  ],
  [
    t("接收 / 查询失败率", "Ingest / query failures"),
    evidence.ingestFailurePercent + "% / " + evidence.queryFailurePercent + "%",
    "< 1%",
  ],
  [t("压测器丢弃任务", "Dropped load iterations"), String(evidence.droppedIterations), "0"],
  [
    t("确认接收 / 实际入库 / 唯一事件", "Acknowledged / stored / unique events"),
    [evidence.acceptedEvents, evidence.storedEvents, evidence.uniqueEventIds]
      .map(number)
      .join(" / "),
    t("完全一致", "Exact reconciliation"),
  ],
  [
    t("结束后全量核对完成", "Full reconciliation after load"),
    "≤ " + evidence.reconciliationUpperBoundSeconds + " s",
    t("10 秒间隔轮询，非精确延迟", "10-second polling, not exact latency"),
  ],
];
---

<PublicLayout
  title={t("本地单机压测 — OpenRUM", "Single-machine benchmarks — OpenRUM")}
  description={t(
    "公开本地机器规格、负载、实测结果与限制。",
    "Local hardware, workloads, measured results and limitations.",
  )}
  lang={lang}
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="site-container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Local benchmark · {evidence.date}</p>
      <h1>{t("本地单机，真实负载。", "One machine. Measured workloads.")}</h1>
      <p>
        {
          t(
            "以下是开发机上的短时混合事件测试，不是云集群测试，也不是生产容量承诺。已保留未通过的压力档位与历史记录。",
            "These short mixed-event results come from a development machine, not a cloud cluster or a production capacity guarantee. Failed load levels and historical results are retained.",
          )
        }
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="site-container content-grid">
      <nav class="local-nav" aria-label={t("压测章节", "Benchmark sections")}>
        <a href="#hardware">{t("机器规格", "Hardware")}</a><a href="#method"
          >{t("测试方法", "Method")}</a
        ><a href="#result">{t("实测结果", "Results")}</a><a href="#limits"
          >{t("边界与历史", "Limits & history")}</a
        >
      </nav>
      <div>
        <section class="prose-section" id="hardware">
          <p class="eyebrow">01 · Hardware</p>
          <h2>{t("明确是哪一台机器、多少资源。", "Hardware and actual resource allocation.")}</h2>
          <p>
            <strong
              >{evidence.hardware.cpu} · {evidence.hardware.cpuCores}
              {t("核", "cores")} · {evidence.hardware.memoryGiB} GiB RAM</strong
            ><br />{evidence.hardware.os} · Docker {evidence.hardware.dockerVersion}
          </p>
          <p>
            {t("Docker 虚拟机：", "Docker VM: ")}{evidence.hardware.dockerCPUs} vCPU / {
              evidence.hardware.dockerMemoryGiB
            } GiB RAM{
              t("。主机内存不等于容器可用内存。", ". Host RAM is not container-available RAM.")
            }
          </p>
          <p>
            {
              t(
                "同一台机器同时运行 k6 与服务。单副本 API、Ingest、Consumer，1 个 Kafka Broker（12 分区、单副本），1 个 ClickHouse 节点，PostgreSQL 与 Redis。Consumer 使用 12 worker、50 ms 批量写入窗口；API 查询 max_threads=2，系统 metric_log 合并块为 1024 行；无单服务 CPU/内存限制。开发工具和既有本地 Kubernetes 也在运行，并非独占压测机。",
                "k6 and services share this machine. Single API, Ingest and Consumer replicas; one Kafka broker (12 partitions, replication factor 1), one ClickHouse node, PostgreSQL and Redis. Consumer: 12 workers, 50 ms flush window; API queries use max_threads=2 and system.metric_log merges use 1,024-row blocks; no per-service CPU/memory limits. Development tools and an existing local Kubernetes node were also running; this was not a dedicated benchmark host.",
              )
            }
          </p>
        </section>
        <section class="prose-section" id="method">
          <p class="eyebrow">02 · Method</p>
          <h2>
            {
              t(
                "写入与查询同时施压，最后逐条核对。",
                "Concurrent ingest and queries, reconciled end to end.",
              )
            }
          </h2>
          <p>
            {t("持续", "Duration:")}
            {evidence.durationSeconds / 60}
            {t("分钟；目标", "minutes; target")}
            {number(evidence.targetEventsPerSecond)} events/s + {evidence.targetQueriesPerSecond} query
            req/s{
              t(
                "。每批 100 个事件，100% 采样，不放宽延迟和失败率门槛。",
                ". 100 events per envelope, 100% sampling; latency and error thresholds were not relaxed.",
              )
            }
          </p>
          <p>
            {
              t(
                "固定混合：40% 自定义事件、20% 页面访问、20% API、10% Web Vital、10% 错误。查询随机覆盖概览、错误、性能、API、用量，范围为最近 1 小时。使用独立测试项目，之前各轮数据保留，因此不是只查空表。",
                "Fixed mix: 40% custom, 20% page views, 20% API, 10% Web Vitals and 10% errors. Queries randomly cover overview, issues, performance, APIs and usage over the last hour. A dedicated test Project retains preceding runs; this is not an empty-table query test.",
              )
            }
          </p>
          <p>
            {t("开始前该测试项目已有", "The test Project held")}
            {number(evidence.startingProjectRows)}
            {t("条原始事件；结束后达到", "raw events before the run, reaching")}
            {number(evidence.endingProjectRows)}
            {t("条。", "afterwards.")}
          </p>
          <pre
            class="code-block"><code>{`# Local-only fixture; private credentials are never published.
go run ./tests/load/local-fixture .openrum/benchmark
# See docs/benchmarks/local-capacity-2026-09-18.md for service setup.
WORKLOAD=mixed CONSUMER_CONTAINER=openrum-benchmark-consumer \\
OPENRUM_BENCHMARK_API_URL=http://openrum-benchmark-api:8080 \\
OPENRUM_BENCHMARK_INGEST_URL=http://openrum-benchmark-ingest:8081/ingest/v1/envelope \\
node tests/load/run-local.mjs .openrum/benchmark unique-run ${evidence.targetEventsPerSecond} ${evidence.targetQueriesPerSecond} ${evidence.durationSeconds}s`}</code></pre>
        </section>
        <section class="prose-section" id="result">
          <p class="eyebrow">03 · Results</p>
          <h2>
            {
              evidence.passed
                ? t("本轮负载：通过本地短时门槛", "This run: local short-run gates passed")
                : t("本轮负载：部分门槛未通过", "This run: some acceptance gates failed")
            }
          </h2>
          <div class="proof-grid">
            <article class="ui-card proof-card">
              <Gauge size={22} /><strong>{number(evidence.acknowledgedEventsPerSecond)}</strong><p>
                {t("实测确认接收 events/s", "Measured acknowledged events/s")}
              </p>
            </article>
            <article class="ui-card proof-card">
              <Gauge size={22} /><strong>{evidence.ingestP95Milliseconds} ms</strong><p>
                Ingest P95
              </p>
            </article>
            <article class="ui-card proof-card">
              <Gauge size={22} /><strong>{evidence.queryP95Milliseconds} ms</strong><p>
                Query P95 · {evidence.targetQueriesPerSecond} req/s
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>
          <div class="benchmark-table-wrap">
            <table>
              <thead
                ><tr
                  ><th>{t("指标", "Signal")}</th><th>{t("结果", "Result")}</th><th
                    >{t("门槛 / 说明", "Threshold / note")}</th
                  ></tr
                ></thead
              ><tbody
                >{
                  results.map(([signal, result, criterion]) => (
                    <tr>
                      <>
                        <td>{signal}</td>
                        <td>{result}</td>
                        <td>{criterion}</td>
                      </>
                    </tr>
                  ))
                }</tbody
              >
            </table>
          </div>
          <p>
            {
              t(
                "消费消息年龄的 10 秒采样最大值：",
                "Maximum consumer message age in 10-second samples: ",
              )
            }{evidence.sampledMaxLagSeconds} s{
              t(
                "。这是采样观测值，不是连续采集的精确峰值。",
                ". This is a sampled observation, not an exact continuously recorded peak.",
              )
            }
          </p>
          <p><code>{evidence.id}</code> · {evidence.date}</p>
          <a class="ui-button ui-button-outline" href="/benchmarks/local-capacity.json" download
            ><Download size={16} />{t("下载本轮数据摘要", "Download this run’s evidence")}</a
          >
        </section>
        <section class="prose-section" id="limits">
          <p class="eyebrow">04 · Limits & history</p>
          <h2>{t("不把本地成绩当成生产承诺。", "Local evidence is not production capacity.")}</h2>
          <p>
            {
              t(
                "10,000 events/s + 30 query req/s 的 60 秒试跑未通过：接收 P95 为 425 ms，压测器丢弃了 53 个接收任务和 9 个查询任务。扩大数据集后，优化前的 5,000 events/s + 30 query req/s 也出现查询超时。3,000 events/s + 10 query req/s 的 5 分钟测试仍有 1.73% 查询失败；降低系统日志合并块后也不能保证消除内存压力。全部尝试记录包含在下载的 JSON 中。",
                "The 60-second 10,000 events/s + 30 query req/s trial failed: ingest P95 was 425 ms, with 53 ingest and 9 query iterations dropped. On the larger dataset, the pre-query-optimization 5,000 events/s + 30 query req/s run also encountered query timeouts. A 5-minute 3,000 events/s + 10 query req/s run still had 1.73% query failures; smaller system log merge blocks do not guarantee that memory pressure is eliminated. All recorded trials are included in the downloadable JSON.",
              )
            }
          </p>
          <p>
            {
              t(
                "2,000 events/s + 10 query req/s 的 5 分钟复测：Ingest P95 50.47 ms，查询 P95 685.16 ms，600,100 条事件全量核对一致、无压测任务丢弃；但 3,001 次查询中有 30 次失败，未通过全部查询成功的严格门槛。因此本页的较低负载结果不能解读为持续容量上限。",
                "The 5-minute 2,000 events/s + 10 query req/s rerun recorded ingest P95 of 50.47 ms, query P95 of 685.16 ms, all 600,100 events reconciled and no dropped iterations. However, 30 of 3,001 queries failed, missing the strict all-queries-successful gate. The lower-load result on this page is not a sustained capacity ceiling.",
              )
            }
          </p>
          <p>
            {t("历史记录（2026-09-03）：", "Historical record (2026-09-03): ")}Ingest P95 {
              previous.ingestP95Seconds
            } s / {previous.ingestFailurePercent}% {t("失败；查询 P95", "failed; Query P95")}
            {previous.queryP95Seconds} s{
              t(
                "。不同负载、数据量和运行版本不能直接算成同条件的性能提升倍数。",
                ". Different loads, datasets and runtime versions do not establish a like-for-like speedup.",
              )
            }
          </p>
          <p>
            {
              t(
                "尚未验证：生产 Kubernetes 多副本、Kafka 高可用、持续 15 分钟以上的生产峰值负载、故障切换、大量路由与高基数字段，以及真实浏览器 SDK 开销。吞吐量不等于并发用户数，本轮也未寻找机器的绝对容量上限。",
                "Not validated: production Kubernetes replicas, Kafka high availability, production-peak runs of 15+ minutes, failover, many routes/high-cardinality fields, or real browser SDK overhead. Throughput is not concurrent users; this run did not establish the machine’s absolute capacity ceiling.",
              )
            }
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PublicLayout>
<style>
  .content-grid > * {
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .benchmark-table-wrap {
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin-block: 24px;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  th,
  td {
    padding: 14px 16px;
    text-align: start;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ds-border);
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  th {
    color: var(--ds-text-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  td:nth-child(2) {
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
</style>
